SUMMARY:The Only Living Pickpocket In New York (2026)
LOCATION:Living Room Theaters\, 341 SW 10th Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5215;-122.6826
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Noah Segan · 88 min\n\nHarry Lehman is an aging pickpocke
 t who plies his trade with ever-diminishing returns in a drastically chang
 ed New York. Wallets stuffed with cash have been replaced by easily cancel
 led credit cards\, and Harry struggles to make ends meet as he cares for h
 is disabled wife\, Rosie. When he unwittingly purloins and fences a valuab
 le USB stick\, Harry finds himself in a race against time to return the lo
 ot or face the rage of a vengeful crime family.\n\nTickets: https://pdx.li
 vingroomtheaters.com/purchase/the-only-living-pickpocket-in-new-york?showi
 ngId=4266631\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screen
 s-pdx/
URL:https://pdx.livingroomtheaters.com/purchase/the-only-living-pickpocket-
 in-new-york?showingId=4266631
END:VEVENT
